# Repository-root ignores.
#
# The app's own ebpco-user-portal/.gitignore uses ROOTED patterns (/node_modules,
# /dist), which anchor to that subdirectory only. Anything installed or generated
# at this level was therefore tracked — a vitest cache under node_modules/ and an
# agent's runtime lock file both reached the initial commit that way.

# Dependencies and build output, at any depth
node_modules/
dist/
.angular/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Agent and editor runtime state
.claude/
.DS_Store
*.log

# NOTE: sweep reports and pending registers are deliberately NOT ignored here.
# This repository is PRIVATE (verified 2026-08-31), so its findings book belongs
# in it — that is how the next agent receives it. The estate rule that keeps
# findings local applies to the PUBLIC repo (eBPCO-Web), not this one. If this
# repo is ever made public, move SWEEP-*.md out BEFORE flipping visibility: it
# inventories the portal's own weaknesses.
